    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your chant grants you some of Ursun&rsquo;s strength. You gain a <strong>+20 bonus on all Melee (Brawling)</strong> Tests, +1 @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.FF41XPboORgyDNsv]{Strong Back} Talent and the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.a8MC97PLzl10WocT]{Big} Trait as your muscles bulge. So great is your strength that grappling tests with @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.8slW8CJ2oVTxeQ6q]{Size (large)} creatures no longer require a Critical Success for Opposed Strength Tests.</p>"
